## Original Code, Visuals, Typography & Audio
- **Pixel Engine, Character & Creature Rigs, Environments & Animation** (`src/px.js`, `src/chars.js`, `src/scenes.js`, `src/main.js`):
  - 100% original procedural 270×480 indexed pixel-art graphics written in JavaScript for this project. No external sprites, tilesets, or stock footage used.
- **Bitmap Pixel Typography** (`src/font.js`):
  - 100% original gothic-serif bitmap pixel glyph matrices created in code for this project. No external font files embedded.
- **Original Musical Score & Procedural Sound Effects** (`mix.py`, with helper DSP filters from repository `core/audio/sfx.py`):
  - 100% original synthesized & physically-modeled 48 kHz stereo score and foley generated deterministically in Python (`numpy` / `scipy`). No third-party audio recordings, sample packs, or copyrighted melodies used.
